					</p>
					<h2 class="text-xl font-bold">Kia EV3 GL</h2>
					<p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
						Battery Electric Vehicle” and “Affordable,” aren’t
